			"notes": "- Updated to 1.14.4\n- Added Quartz and Glowstone Melons\n- Melons now only grow on blocks of their materials\n- Only sky light stops melons from growing now\n- Changed how growth speed is determined\n- Changed ids of seeds\n- Seeds can now be crafted (surround a vanilla melon seed with blocks of a material)\n- You can now get extra seeds from a full melon block in a crafting bench\n- Chance of plants dying changed to 1 in 8\n- Added creative tab\n- Made it easier for addons to exist\n- No longer overwrites dungeon loot table\n- Attempted to inject seeds into vanilla loot tables, but it doesn't seem to work :/\n- Stems are now coloured\n- Probably other changes I've forgotten"
